OL,3,GNEWSASea 'scarecrows' to help prevent
OL,4,Aseabird deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "floating scarecrow" has helped stop
OL,7,Fendangered seabirds such as guillemots
OL,8,Fand razorbill getting caught in fishing
OL,9,Fnets, researchers have said.
OL,11,FScientists from Fishtek Marine, based
OL,12,Fin Devon, developed the device known as
OL,13,Fa Looming Eye Buoy with the RSPB before
OL,14,Ftrialling it off the Cornish coast.
OL,16,FThe research, analysed by the
OL,17,FUniversity of Exeter, suggested the
OL,18,Fscarecrow device, which has a spinning
OL,19,Ftop using an animated eye effect to
OL,20,Fscare birds, decreased the risk of rare
OL,21,Fbirds being caught in nets by about
OL,22,Ftwo-thirds.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
