OL,3,GNEWSASea 'scarecrows' to help prevent
OL,4,Aseabird deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists said simple deterrents could
OL,7,Fhave a positive impact on species like
OL,8,Fguillemots and razorbill which are on
OL,9,Fthe Amber List of UK Birds of
OL,10,FConservation Concern.
